 "pipelineNeeds": [
  "sheets.py picks the sheet number from the file name (s3 -> Arun sheet 3). Companion files need the map s2->1, s3->5, s4->6 (rows 1-2) + 7 (row 3 = bare only, no weapon row), s5->9 (face4 layout); s1 is reference only.",
  "brief_spec target_h is fixed (48/64/80). Companions need a per-character override from heightDots (e.g. dokka 52/39, teo 56/42, hagen 68/51); otherwise the pipeline would rescale them to 64/48.",
  "New layouts: battle_action_bare (3x5, rows 1-2 = SHEETS[6] ids, row 3 = SHEETS[7] row 1 ids) and face4 (1x4 with face_pain).",
  "Walk sheet has no lantern and no run/act sheets; the engine tweens acting poses from walk_down_0.",
  "meta.weapon of the packed battle set = weaponType (so the engine uses bare+weapons only when the equipped type differs); weapons set copied from Arun.",
  "No facing references exist for companions: build configs/refs/<id> from the approved s1 turnaround (tools/refs.py) before checking s2-s5."
 ],
